(text "2S Li-ion only: 8.4 V termination, 6.04 kOhm PROG, 1.5 MHz.\nRequires a protected, balanced 2S pack and 103AT-2 10k NTC on the cells. CE defaults disabled.\nFirmware validates PD contract, programs limits, checks temperature and then enables charging." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5055fec6-a4e4-4e13-9cc4-a8b82cdee73e))
